WIRE.md §6.1, §6.6 (DECISIONS 420): `load.csv` follows load.dir's link bounds; a path that is a
link whose target resolves outside the declared roots and the project is E7004 ReadOutsideRoots.
-- call --
load.csv("lnk.csv")
-- type --
strings
-- symlinks --
lnk.csv ../outside/x.csv
-- /outside/x.csv --
a,b
-- findings.txt --
error[E7004]  call:1:1
  cannot read lnk.csv: reached through a symbolic link outside the roots and the project

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
